 147:Drivers/lvgl/src/misc/../../include/lvgl/core/lv_style.h ****  * Props are split into groups of 16. When adding a new prop to a group, ensure it does not overflo
 148:Drivers/lvgl/src/misc/../../include/lvgl/core/lv_style.h ****  */
